WEBVTT

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.510
Hey, this is our spot.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.220
You're not allowed to use it.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.640
I'm sorry. I didn't know...

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.640
You live around here, don't you?
Why don't you know?

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.690
This is the first time
I came to this park, so...

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.360
Huh... Well, whatever.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.440
These things you brought with you.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.650
We'll take them as payment
for you barging in here.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.950
You can't have them!

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:35.990
No!

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.160
You got in our way!

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.200
Yeah!

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.040
Hey, she started crying.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.080
I'm not crying!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.290
Hey!

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.750
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.630
Don't be mean to Chi-<i>chan</i>!

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.050
Who the heck are you?

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:58.350
Just give that back to Chi-<i>chan</i>!
It's important to her!

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.140
I didn't want it anyway!

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:05.140
There.

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:09.110
Thanks... But they might
try to get back at you.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:14.780
It's okay. I'll protect you, Chi-<i>chan</i>.
Call me if you ever need me.

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.610
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:23.370
That was the moment I realized...
This isn't how I wanted things to be.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:27.120
I wanted to help Kanon-<i>chan </i>someday.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.710
No matter what.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.800
Okay!

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:40.180
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:50.150
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:06.960
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.460
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.130
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.920
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.840
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:23.260
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.350
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:30.020
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:35.110
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:37.400
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.450
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:45.830
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:51.620
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:57.010
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:02.840
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:09.060
That tickles... Jeez.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:12.310
Ow, ow! What the heck?

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.480
Morning.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.730
You two sure are close.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.570
Huh? N-No, we're not!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:21.650
Get ready, and we're going to
meet outside in 15 minutes.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.110
Good morning!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.570
You're awake?

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.410
We're gonna start training
for our concert starting today!

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:28.910
"I Was Dreaming"

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:28.910
We're gonna start training
for our concert starting today!

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:31.330
"I Was Dreaming"

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:31.330
And here's your regimen for today.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.170
No way...

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.920
Jogging 10 kilometers?

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.920
That's no problem
as long as we're with them!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:42.840
Says the one who has zero energy.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:45.470
I'll catch up.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:48.640
It takes me 30 minutes to do my hair.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.730
You can do that later.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.940
Silly. Appearances are important,
even if we're just training.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.270
That's what it takes
to survive in show business.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:01.740
Anyway, they thought up
this regimen for us.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.490
You are absolutely not allowed to skip it.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.240
I'm not going to skip it!

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:09.580
With all of this training,
we'll get even more energy and stamina...

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.160
...than before...

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.460
Are you okay?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:18.090
I swear, we just keep trying to
nurse you back to health.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.550
Sorry about this.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:23.380
Maybe she doesn't have all of her energy
back from all the fun we had yesterday.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:27.800
She had zero energy to begin with,
so this was expected.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.470
What do you want to do?
Head back to your lodgings?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:34.810
No, that'll make Keke-<i>chan </i>sad.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:35.650
♬ ...forever ♬

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.230
♬ HOT! HOT! Happy Day! ♬

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:39.520
♬ Welcome to WONDERLAND! ♬

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.610
That was amazing!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.820
And she's back.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.160
Thank goodness.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.660
We're looking forward to
your performance, too.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.200
All right, let's go look at the stage.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.000
It's fantastic.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.420
Everyone at school is helping to build it.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.040
Everyone at school?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:03.050
It should look even more
beautiful by the concert.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:06.590
There are only so many
people on the island,

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.470
so everyone at school decided to

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:14.060
liven up the island along with us.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.520
For the island...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.230
You feel this mysterious power

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:19.860
when you know you're doing
something for someone else.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:23.900
Everything becomes fun,
even if it's difficult.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.280
What?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:31.490
Oh, nothing. We need to do our best, too.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.290
You were swaying again.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.160
Right.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:40.460
Let's take a 10-minute break.
We'll pick back up where we left off.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.380
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.180
Arashi-<i>san</i>.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.220
Are you practicing?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.940
Yeah... the contest is coming up.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.270
I see.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.940
So you're not with Shibuya-<i>san</i>
and her friends?

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:03.980
Yeah.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:08.280
Kanon-<i>chan </i>and the others have an event
coming up, so they aren't here right now.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.700
Are you okay with that?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:16.040
It sounded like you were rather involved
with the school idols activities.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.710
So you're worried about us?

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.000
Not exactly...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.960
Don't worry. We didn't
get in a fight or anything.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.880
"School Withdrawal Application"

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:28.380
Withdr--

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.220
Did you see that?

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.680
N-No... See what?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.440
Nothing.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.980
I messed up.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.820
What are you doing?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.410
Wow... What's this black stuff?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:55.660
I decided to make them dinner tonight
since they've been so welcoming to us!

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:58.460
Shanghai <i>xiaolongbao</i>, <i>hong shao rou</i>,

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.670
and Shanghai-style crab...

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.790
And you somehow ended up with this...

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.960
I messed up the cooking times...

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.340
Oh, fine.

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.470
What? You can cook?

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.140
If it's something simple, sure.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.900
I somehow feel very frustrated.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.980
What are you doing?

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.780
Did I scare you?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.370
Sorry I didn't notice you.
I've been writing lyrics.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.200
Huh... So you do the writing, huh?

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:43.540
I sometimes write with Keke-<i>chan</i>,
but this time, it's just me.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.170
I got some inspiration
from what you said earlier.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:51.340
Earlier? Did I say anything
that inspiring?

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.180
You said you felt this power
when you worked hard for the island.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.850
Ah...

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:59.970
I was just imagining

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:04.980
how we would feel
if we were in that situation.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:09.570
You're not doing this for your school?

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:15.490
No. There are even people at our school
who oppose our activities.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:20.330
They say they'd support us
if we weren't school idols, but...

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.540
Well, it's not like you can't
continue being school idols

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:28.550
just because you're not doing it
for something specific.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.670
There are plenty of people who do it
just because they love to sing.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:36.760
Yes. That's how we see it right now.
I think it's the same way for Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.890
Oh, the dancer girl.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:42.020
Yes! She has a contest coming up.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:45.690
She wants to be successful in dance,
so she's working really hard!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.940
So that's why she's not here.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.900
Chi-<i>chan</i>'s loved to dance
ever since she was little

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.820
and has been practicing ever since.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.910
Is it just because she loves to do it?

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.990
I don't know all the details,

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:03.370
but I'm not sure if that's enough of
a reason to do separate things.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:16.130
It's so good! You two made
all of this by yourselves?

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.430
Wow.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.350
But I think it tastes even better

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:22.060
because all of the ingredients
from this island are amazing.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:22.890
Right?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.270
Huh? I, uh...

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:30.440
These dishes are a specialty
from Keke's homeland, right?

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:33.070
But I didn't make them...

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.490
Whatever, just go along
with what I'm saying.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.200
You need to always be
smiling and confident

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.280
if you want to last in show business.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.700
This is just lying!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.160
It's true that we were both
standing in the kitchen!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.540
You still piss me off.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:49.130
What the heck? I cooked all this
in your place for you.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.340
--No one asked you to!
--They're so close.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.090
I'm so sorry.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:56.420
Let's hurry up and eat.
It's a full moon tonight.

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.890
The moon is so big.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.060
It's beautiful.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.140
I should send a picture to Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.400
"Chi-<i>chan</i>"
"The moon is so big.
It probably looks even prettier
from where you are"

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.110
What is it?

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.030
No, it's nothing.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.320
"Can I call you?"

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.660
"Can I call you?"
"Sure"

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.540
Hello? Did you read them?

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.000
"Tokonatsu ☆ Sunshine"

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.000
Hello? Did you read them?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.540
"Tokonatsu ☆ Sunshine"

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.540
Yeah. I think they're great.
It sounds like something you'd write.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.130
Yeah. I think they're great.
It sounds like something you'd write.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:34.550
I just felt like.... I want to
help so many people.

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:37.260
I want to sing for everyone... So, yeah.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.590
--Yeah.
--Oh,

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.970
sorry I kept talking about me.
Did you just finish practice?

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.470
Yeah, I'm heading home.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.640
Your contest is coming up soon, right?

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:47.640
Yeah...

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:51.350
You'll be fine, Chi-<i>chan</i>.
Just do what you usually do.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.730
Thanks...

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.450
Say--

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.280
Oh, sorry. Go ahead.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.990
No, you go first.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:07.910
No, it's not really that important.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.120
It's just... once the contest is over...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:16.590
No, never mind. What did you want to say?

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.050
Actually, mine's not a big deal, either.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.340
So I can tell you the next time I see you.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:28.270
Well, do your best. Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.270
How'd it go?

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.480
Um!

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.860
I have a request.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.120
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:11:58.510 --> 00:11:59.550
Good morning.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.470
Wow, that's amazing.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:04.800
I used to also do
some figure skating, too.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:07.310
If you can dance that well,
you can probably do anything.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.810
I can't compare to you,
though, Arashi-<i>san</i>.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:12.850
The contest is today, isn't it?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:16.150
Yeah. It's this afternoon.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:19.650
I thought I'd check over
the choreography one last time.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.900
I see... So Shibuya-<i>san</i>
and the others are...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.620
Yeah... They have their concert.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.830
Is something wrong?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.830
No! Um, please do your best!

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.420
Um...

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:44.130
It's nothing.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.680
It's nothing.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:53.810
Um...

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.810
Yes?

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.360
I see. So you did see it.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.150
Please believe me when I say
that it wasn't on purpose!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.950
It was just a coincidence, and...

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:08.580
If I can't win the contest, I decided
I was going to quit this school.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.870
But...

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:13.410
I figured it's not a bad idea
to train overseas.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.830
Why?

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:17.960
Because I won't be able
to help Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:22.010
In that case, there's no point
in me to continue dancing here.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:25.510
I'm sorry, I don't understand.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:30.260
When I was little,
I would get bullied a lot.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.110
What is she doing?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.450
She's by herself?

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.570
Doesn't she have any friends?

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:48.740
I hate gloomy kids.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:52.700
I used to be weak, and I had no energy.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.000
And I was always scared of something.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:13.010
What's wrong?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:19.230
Kanon-<i>chan </i>always saved me.

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:21.310
Let's go play over there!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.570
But I...

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.280
Come on!

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:29.490
I'll be by your side, okay?

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.540
See? Isn't this amazing?

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:44.670
Kanon-<i>chan </i>taught me all sorts of things.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.220
Like the importance of moving forward,

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:50.340
how fun it can be to
discover something new...

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:55.180
So I wanted to be worthy of
standing next to Kanon-<i>chan </i>one day.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:58.230
What does that have to do with dance?

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.440
Wait...

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:03.770
Yeah. The reason I started dancing
is because of Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:09.110
If I wanted to help Kanon-<i>chan</i>,
I couldn't be my old self.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:13.410
I had to be able to do something
on my own that Kanon-<i>chan </i>couldn't.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:14.580
On your own?

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:20.460
Yeah. I need to get good at something
so I could feel confident in myself.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:24.880
Until then, I decided not to do
anything with Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.670
Is that why you didn't
become a school idol?

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:32.180
Yeah. It's something I decided for myself.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:38.680
Until I can prove myself in dance
and actually help out Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:42.060
That's why today's the day.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.770
I'm going to get going.

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.860
If you...

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:54.320
If you're able to establish yourself
in dance, what will you do next?

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:57.740
Isn't it obvious?

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.330
It's almost done!

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:01.410
Pa!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.040
This is a first.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.750
I can't believe you
made all this in one night.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.670
It's going to be even better
by tomorrow's concert!

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:10.590
Behold!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:17.760
Now I've paid you back
for dinner! We're even!

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.680
What are you even talking about?

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.520
"Dance Contest Participants
Greenroom"

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.400
"Kanon Shibuya"
"The contest is about to start"
"I'll do my best"

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.320
"Kanon-<i>chan</i>"
"I'm sorry"
"That I didn't notice"

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.030
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.210
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.130
Why...

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.260
I came.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:59.560
Something sounded off
when we talked on the phone.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:03.810
I thought that you might
be really anxious.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:06.520
I might be wrong, but...

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:10.980
Oh, there's just one thing
I wanted to tell you.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:14.450
I've always admired you so much, Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.200
You always work so hard,
and even if you mess up a little,

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.990
you never get depressed
or let it get to you.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.290
So...

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.460
I can't...

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:29.170
I need to do my best on my own...

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:31.420
Until I can be confident on my own,

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:36.010
I wanted to do this by myself
when you weren't around...

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.970
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:42.470
But when I saw you, I felt relieved.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:48.310
It's not your fault, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.
It's my fault for being weak.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.190
I was trying not to rely on you.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:55.240
I was going to finally do something
that you can't do on my own today.

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.490
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:01.830
Despite how I seem,
I'm pretty competitive.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:07.460
Well, I always thought
you were saving me, too.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:13.050
When I couldn't sing, when I messed up...
It was always you who helped me out.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:15.840
But that was just because you...

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.470
Then I guess we're in the same boat!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:22.390
We both did our best.
We were always watching each other

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.890
and thought the other was important.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:30.860
I was really moved back then.
My whole body trembled.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.730
I'm going to do something you can't do.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:39.410
Something like your singing!
Something I can love and obsess over!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:42.030
I'm going to do my best!

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.040
You were just so cool.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.420
I told myself that I had to be like you.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:55.130
That I needed to get so good at singing
that no one could compare.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.840
Thank you.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:04.970
It's because of your words
that I can sing right now.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.030
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.650
Ye--

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.070
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:21.410
Wait for me.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.210
Good luck out there, Chi-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.500
"Chisato Arashi wins!"

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.500
♬ I want to make the best memories
bloom forever ♬

